      "pinyin": "zhèng pā zài zhuō zi shang hū hū dà shuì de bǎo luó hóng zhe liǎn zhàn qǐ lai bù hǎo yì si de shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "“老师，您问我什么问题呀？”",
      "traditional": "“老師，您問我什麼問題呀？”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī nín wèn wǒ shén me wèn tí ya",
      "english": "Paul was lying on his desk fast asleep. His face reddening, he stood up and sheepishly said:"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“Teacher, what was your question?”"
