    "sentence_translations": [
      "Questions and Rhetorical Questions",
      "",
      "One day when teaching grammar, in order to check the students’ progress, the teacher asked Paul:",
      "“Please give an example of a question.”",
      "",
      "Paul was lying on his desk fast asleep. His face reddening, he stood up and sheepishly said:",
      "“Teacher, what was your question?”",
      "",
      "The teacher said, “Very good, now please give an example of a rhetorical question.”",
      "",
      "Paul was extremely puzzled, ″How could that have been right?”",
      "",
      "Joy was written all over the teacher’s face. “Amazing! You understand all of today’s material. Please sit down.”"
    ]
